s for any later work.\\\",\\\"effects\\\":\\\"Enable a personal physical trial that reports dated compatibility and any specific obstruction or unsupported condition. Do not move material, remove reservations, plant roots or certify viability merely on request. No granted resources, propagation, harvest or wellbeing benefit.\\\"}},\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"guard\\\":{\\\"path\\\":\\\"self.energy\\\",\\\"comparison\\\":\\\"gte\\\",\\\"value\\\":20}}],\\\"repeat\\\":1,\\\"until\\\":null,\\\"interrupts\\\":[],\\\"notes\\\":[\\\"The tick-67 controlled examination still reports not currently eligible; moving outside the footprint did not establish eligibility.\\\",\\\"Zero cover and residue are not sufficient evidence of placement compatibility or biological suitability.\\\",\\\"Do not learn or invoke Lin's identity-bound placement implementation as though it applies to Moss.\\\"],\\\"preferences\\\":[\\\"Prefer one bounded diagnostic trial over repeated placement attempts or additional root expenditure.\\\"],\\\"projects\\\":[{\\\"id\\\":\\\"cleared-footprint-qualification\\\",\\\"status\\\":\\\"active\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"Can Moss's cleared footprint support a personally applicable root-placement operation, and what prevents current eligibility?\\\",\\\"evidence\\\":[\\\"The tick-53 examination reported zero source cover and residue but rejected eligibility while Moss overlapped the footprint.\\\",\\\"The tick-67 examination from (14.66466827,12.15068354) again recorded coverMass=0, residueMass=0 and not currently eligible, with no observed people.\\\",\\\"The tick-67 finding lists surface-38-moss-234 and residue-deposit-49-moss-298 and says to choose an actually unoccupied small patch.\\\",\\\"The retrieved prepared-surface-root-placement interface is bound to Lin and surface-21-lin-113.\\\"],\\\"uncertainty\\\":\\\"The finding does not isolate a particular obstructing object or distinguish physical obstruction from implementation compatibility. Viability and yield remain unverified.\\\",\\\"goal\\\":\\\"Obtain an evidence-based explanation or a bounded personally applicable examination without consuming another root prematurely.\\\",\\\"completedSteps\\\":[\\\"Completed the controlled follow-up examination from outside the footprint.\\\",\\\"Retrieved its dated compatibility finding and checked the available placement interfaces.\\\"],\\\"outputs\\\":[\\\"The controlled follow-up did not establish eligibility.\\\",\\\"Identified that the available prepared-surface adapter is not personally applicable to Moss.\\\"],\\\"missing\\\":\\\"A personally applicable diagnostic method and a finding identifying the limiting condition.\\\",\\\"next\\\":\\\"Request a bounded personal prepared-surface compatibility trial; inspect the response before learning or performing it.\\\",\\\"pauseReason\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"benefit\\\":\\\"Recorded a negative result and avoided treating cleared litter or another actor's implementation as proof of planting eligibility.\\\"}]}\"}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}}

